WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.500
Your AI agent can browse the web.

00:00:03.575 --> 00:00:06.300
Right up until it hits a login page.

00:00:06.362 --> 00:00:08.500
Then you get two bad options:

00:00:08.512 --> 00:00:11.150
hand it your password, or babysit it.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:15.200
Auth Your Agent is the third option.

00:00:15.275 --> 00:00:16.525
One rule:

00:00:16.563 --> 00:00:19.100
your agent never sees your password,

00:00:19.075 --> 00:00:21.350
and anything that changes something waits

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.475
for your thumb.

00:00:23.925 --> 00:00:26.288
On most websites, your agent works in the

00:00:26.188 --> 00:00:27.050
vault:

00:00:27.088 --> 00:00:29.375
a sandboxed browser, in Docker,

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:31.000
on your own machine.

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.900
If you keep your logins in Bitwarden or Vaultwarden,

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:39.437
the vault can type a saved password or authenticator

00:00:39.337 --> 00:00:41.100
code for your agent.

00:00:41.163 --> 00:00:43.725
The agent only names the item.

00:00:43.725 --> 00:00:45.775
It never sees the value.

00:00:47.275 --> 00:00:49.700
Anything a saved login can't handle,

00:00:49.638 --> 00:00:52.000
like a captcha, a texted code,

00:00:51.975 --> 00:00:54.475
or a site you haven't saved, goes to your

00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:55.375
phone.

00:00:55.437 --> 00:00:57.875
It buzzes, you see the live page,

00:00:57.863 --> 00:01:00.125
sign in yourself, and hand it back.

00:01:01.675 --> 00:01:03.150
Reading is free.

00:01:03.175 --> 00:01:05.163
But when it clicks something that would change

00:01:05.063 --> 00:01:07.125
something, like submit or buy,

00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:09.650
that click is held until you tap Approve,

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:10.675
or Deny.

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:12.700
Payments always ask.

00:01:12.762 --> 00:01:15.625
For the rest, you pick a mode for each site.

00:01:17.075 --> 00:01:19.700
When the job is done, the vault signs out,

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:22.350
checks that it worked, and wipes the browser.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:26.025
Websites can also build it in:

00:01:26.063 --> 00:01:28.550
a sign in with your agent button.

00:01:28.612 --> 00:01:31.100
The agent signs with its own key,

00:01:31.125 --> 00:01:33.950
you approve with a passkey, and the site gets

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:37.075
short-lived tokens tied to that one agent.

00:01:38.575 --> 00:01:39.850
Auth Your Agent.

00:01:39.887 --> 00:01:43.125
The vault and MCP server are free and open

00:01:43.025 --> 00:01:43.875
source.

00:01:43.925 --> 00:01:46.550
Find it at auth your agent dot com.
